          "value": "## Expected Result\n\n**Class stack:** dark outer stroke and cyan center. **Override:** violet outer stroke and white dashed center instead of class colors. **Straight:** two parallel-looking stacked paints on one straight route. **Avoidance:** two-stroke curved route detours around the gray node with air between them. Labels and arrows stay on their own edges."
        }
      },
